'''Cornelia''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.8 Update|Version 3.8]] and was created by a collaboration event between [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Merc Storia Collaboration Gacha]] and can be unlocked by drawing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the event period.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 186
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Cornelia
|name2 = Cornelia CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cornelia CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Cornelia's stats are very low, and her niche is very plain, but she does have the not so saving grace of a decent cost and quick cooldown. Against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies, she's horrible as a generalist and her freeze is very unreliable thanks to her low chance, which is outclassed by non Uber units, such as [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bomber Cat]].
Against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies, her freeze is even more worthless, since Dark enemies tend to have lots of knockbacks, making Cornelia miss and potentially clip because of her high speed and small backswing, and die thanks to her pitiful health.

Overall, she's very weak and outclassed by non uber rare alternatives, which provide much higher value against her targets. The best comparison to make to her would be [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Holy Valkyrie Cat]], who is a mediocre unit who although has lower freeze duration, but targeting more traits, making Cornelia even worse. Cornelia is one of the worst ubers in the set and the game, and isn't useful for anything except EoC.

